# What the build does not need and the upload should not carry.
#
# The first production deploy died with "Upload aborted" because the CLI was
# shipping the whole working directory: the inspiration references, the generated
# art, the analysis zip and the local tool caches. None of it is an input of
# `npm run build`; all of it is hundreds of megabytes.
node_modules
dist
.git
.worktrees
.codegraph
.atl
.edge-tmp
.playwright-mcp
supabase/.temp
inspiration
design/art
tools/.tmp
*.zip
